# Adidas-Sales-Dashboard
This Power BI dashboard provides a comprehensive analysis of Adidas sales performance for 2020–2021 using interactive visualizations and business intelligence techniques. It highlights key KPIs such as total sales, profit, units sold, and average margin to deliver a quick overview of overall performance.

The dashboard further analyzes sales by product category, region, retailer, and sales method to identify top-performing segments and business opportunities. Monthly sales and profit trends help track year-over-year growth and seasonal patterns, while geographical insights reveal the highest contributing states and regions.

Advanced features like decomposition tree analysis and sales forecasting enable deeper insights, root-cause analysis, and future business planning, supporting smarter and data-driven decision-making.
